Subject: [PATCH] flourite: enumerate vendor camera keys outside HyperOS

Port the working flourite static-capability enumeration to Camera 6.7.000070.0.
Retain the native Flourite profiles and actual HAL feature values; do not
spoof HyperOS or force unsupported capture modes.

diff --git a/smali_classes4/n9/f.smali b/smali_classes4/n9/f.smali
--- a/smali_classes4/n9/f.smali
+++ b/smali_classes4/n9/f.smali
@@ -2150,12 +2150,6 @@
 
     iput-object p2, p0, Ln9/f;->f:Ljava/util/HashMap;
 
-    invoke-static {}, LBa/b;->p()Z
-
-    move-result p2
-
-    if-eqz p2, :cond_1
-
     invoke-static {p1}, Leq/b;->c(Landroid/hardware/camera2/CameraCharacteristics;)Landroid/hardware/camera2/impl/CameraMetadataNative;
 
     move-result-object p2
